% covers: 10 - POST /api with the token and Sec-Fetch-Site: cross-site, same-site or none is 403 Forbidden each, and a following valid disp(x) finds x unassigned: none of the refused requests reached the interpreter
POST /api HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8123
Sec-Fetch-Site: cross-site
X-SplatCrab-Token: test-token
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 39

{"id":1,"op":"eval","code":"x = 1 + 2"}
POST /api HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8123
Sec-Fetch-Site: same-site
X-SplatCrab-Token: test-token
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 39

{"id":2,"op":"eval","code":"x = 1 + 2"}
POST /api HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8123
Sec-Fetch-Site: none
X-SplatCrab-Token: test-token
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 39

{"id":3,"op":"eval","code":"x = 1 + 2"}
POST /api HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8123
X-SplatCrab-Token: test-token
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 37

{"id":4,"op":"eval","code":"disp(x)"}
